# Expo CNG / Prebuild — both native folders are regenerated on every EAS
# Build via `expo prebuild`, driven by app.config.js + Expo config plugins.
# Committing them causes EAS to SKIP prebuild and ship a stale native shell
# that doesn't know about newly-installed modules. Symptom we hit:
#   * Android (v19 cloud build): missing @rnmapbox/maps Maven repo →
#     "Could not find com.mapbox.maps:android-ndk27"
#   * iOS (v1.0.1 build 21): @rnmapbox/maps native module not in Podfile,
#     so `Mapbox.setAccessToken` is undefined → "undefined is not a function"
#     ErrorBoundary on app launch.
# Custom native plist values + permissions all flow through app.config.js
# (ios.infoPlist, android.permissions, plugins), so nothing is lost.
/android/
/ios/
